    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779290/extras/df686e5deb5411ddd0019c5c33f82cda.avif?t=1731618080\" width=600 height=255 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779290/extras/0a59ba3d7e1c5f8d7464a3238cec926e.webp?t=1731618080\" width=600 height=50 /></span><br><br>Harnessing the raw power of Unreal Engine 5, <strong>Gone Camping!</strong> is a small indie First-Person bow &amp; arrow shooter focused on adventure and open-world exploration. Inspired by games like Zelda, Skyrim, and Far Cry. You are free to chill and camp in the great outdoors, take a hike, go hunting/fishing, drive an assortment of vehicles, or bravely dive into caves and dungeons filled with dangerous puzzles, creatures, and undead warriors.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779290/extras/7aa2d396afd14df239b2b3e779b519f1.poster.avif?t=1731618080\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779290/extras/7aa2d396afd14df239b2b3e779b519f1.webm?t=1731618080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779290/extras/7aa2d396afd14df239b2b3e779b519f1.mp4?t=1731618080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>Setup camp to establish your next base of operations. Cook up a refreshing meal at the campfire to heal up, then rest in your tent to save your progress and progress the time of day. From here you can go for a hike, discover a new dungeon to challenge with your Bow &amp; Arrow and unlock new items, or kick simply back and relax with a lo-fi beat chill-mode to enjoy the nature that surrounds you. The choice is yours!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779290/extras/b024502426c88c4d9b02b08caa4b8aa1.poster.avif?t=1731618080\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779290/extras/b024502426c88c4d9b02b08caa4b8aa1.webm?t=1731618080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779290/extras/b024502426c88c4d9b02b08caa4b8aa1.mp4?t=1731618080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779290/extras/df3525e4fee44a19c0f62502fe5cf95f.webp?t=1731618080\" width=600 height=50 /></span>",
